oring and analysis of the political landscape will be crucial for a comprehensive understanding of the evolving dynamics within the United States and its role on the global stage.\nReferences\n[1] President of the united states. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/\nPresident_of_the_United_States . Accessed: 2025-08-01.\n3",
